ri" xlink:href="http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/jan/06_0131.htm">http://www.cdc.gov/pcd/issues/2008/jan/06_0131.htm</ext-link>. Accessed [<italic>date</italic>].				</p></fn></fn-group></back></article>